{"id":"n14629-1-9","stage":4,"title":"가속 · 加速","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14629-1-9-1","ko":"오토바이는 어떻게 가속을 하는 거야?","zh":"摩托车是怎么加速的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오토바이는","meaning":"摩托车","explanation":"오토바이：摩托车；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오토바이","audio":"/audio/2e0f1d0853169eda6cfe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68235","senseId":"1","lemma":"오토바이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가속을","meaning":"加速，提速","explanation":"가속：加速，提速；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"가속","audio":"/audio/514581cc182da23954a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14629","senseId":"1","lemma":"가속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"以某种方式构成行为。","explanation":"하다：以某种方式构成行为。；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"25","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2e0f1d0853169eda","term":"오토바이","zh":"摩托车","audio":"/audio/2e0f1d0853169eda6cfe.mp3","entryId":"68235","definition":"发动机驱动的两轮车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"514581cc182da239","term":"가속","zh":"加速，提速","audio":"/audio/514581cc182da23954a2.mp3","entryId":"14629","definition":"提高速度；或指那种速度。","pronunciation":["가속"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"以某种方式构成行为。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"以某种方式构成行为。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/dd7d8c0e44571b478786.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14629-1-9-2","ko":"이 손잡이를 돌리면 속도가 점점 빨라져.","zh":"转动这个把手，速度就会逐渐变快。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손잡이를","meaning":"扶手，拉手","explanation":"손잡이：扶手，拉手；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"손잡이","audio":"/audio/f011887b5ddd561ade0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63884","senseId":"1","lemma":"손잡이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌리면","meaning":"转，旋转","explanation":"돌리다：转，旋转；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"돌리다","audio":"/audio/6d22f9fa2b8915ddd6fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71457","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"속도가","meaning":"速度","explanation":"속도：速度；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"속도","audio":"/audio/c03f7e871a4127c448d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64215","senseId":"1","lemma":"속도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"점점","meaning":"越来越","explanation":"점점：越来越","readings":[{"term":"점점","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70871","senseId":"1","lemma":"점점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빨라져.","meaning":"快，快速；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"빠르다：快，快速；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"빠르다","audio":"/audio/904de91feaff572f721f.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68755","senseId":"2","lemma":"빠르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"f011887b5ddd561a","term":"손잡이","zh":"扶手，拉手","audio":"/audio/f011887b5ddd561ade0d.mp3","entryId":"63884","definition":"为了方便手抓住某东西而加上去的部分。","pronunciation":["손자비"]},{"id":"6d22f9fa2b8915dd","term":"돌리다","zh":"转，旋转","audio":"/audio/6d22f9fa2b8915ddd6fa.mp3","entryId":"71457","definition":"使某物画着圆圈移动。","pronunciation":["돌리다"]},{"id":"c03f7e871a4127c4","term":"속도","zh":"速度","audio":"/audio/c03f7e871a4127c448d9.mp3","entryId":"64215","definition":"物体移动或事情进行的快慢。","pronunciation":["속또"]},{"id":"2de57161655ba687","term":"점점","zh":"越来越","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3","entryId":"70871","definition":"程度随着时间的推移而逐渐地。","pronunciation":["점ː점"]},{"id":"904de91feaff572f","term":"빠르다","zh":"快，快速","audio":"/audio/904de91feaff572f721f.mp3","entryId":"68755","definition":"从一处移动到其它地方所用的时间短。","pronunciation":["빠르다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/afee2ac81c0d203cc82c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.093,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14629","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":147,"sequenceScore":2.9197,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["转动这个把手，速度就会逐渐变快。","摩托车是怎么加速的？","你不能那样过日子的。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["摩托车是怎么加速的？","你不能那样过日子的。","转动这个把手，速度就会逐渐变快。"],"answer":2}]}
